#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:5
#: 5ad5ac5e122b4527bb0a1e7dff9c4cd5
msgid "Documents"
msgstr "Dokumenti"

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:9
#: 79412ddded90442083722cc0fdda87f6
msgid "You can store and share administrative documents from Galette, like statuses, meeting minutes, and so on."
msgstr ""
"Iz Galette lahko shranjujete in delite administrativne dokumente, kot so "
"statusi, zapisniki sestankov in tako naprej."

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:11
#: 448bedc6dfc143e29e4f94b86ab76a22
msgid "Documents list"
msgstr "Seznam dokumentov"

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:16
#: 36b3e015025d432cbc3471ddeac6df8e
msgid "This is dispatched in two parts:"
msgstr "To se odpošlje v dveh delih:"

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:18
#: 4a3ce4a69a3c4b01a584e8c45d9c42c4
msgid "**Documents management**: where you can add, edit, and delete documents - available from Management, Documents menu;"
msgstr ""
"**Upravljanje dokumentov**: kjer lahko dodajate, urejate in brišete "
"dokumente – na voljo v meniju Upravljanje, Dokumenti;"

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:19
#: 6c4391a40a144107a8d40e3e28765270
msgid "**Public list**: where documents can be seen - available from Public pages, Documents menu."
msgstr ""
"**Javni seznam**: kje si je mogoče ogledati dokumente – dostopno na Javnih "
"straneh, v meniju Dokumenti."

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:22
#: 432731b7c2344735a31747be5b23a535
msgid "Management"
msgstr "Upravljanje"

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:24
#: 4eedd43ed26b41c38f236c668a1a62a5
msgid "Documents management list"
msgstr "Seznam za upravljanje dokumentov"

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:29
#: d9ff15061368420fb42420bcc7c05ec6
msgid "Add a document"
msgstr "Dodaj dokument"

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:34
#: 80c8736a4f174fc297e90316b01071d3
msgid "When creating or editing a document, you will of course choose a file to upload, a document type and a permission."
msgstr ""
"Pri ustvarjanju ali urejanju dokumenta boste seveda izbrali datoteko za "
"nalaganje, vrsto dokumenta in dovoljenje."

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:36
#: 896f9e33a18143ad8a9a72de4f071df0
msgid "Several possible documents types are available from the list, you add a new one by just entering your text in the field."
msgstr ""
"Na seznamu je na voljo več možnih vrst dokumentov, novega dodate tako, da "
"preprosto vnesete besedilo v polje."

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:38
#: 075e036abc304b7b9ff582e4a8e53257
msgid "Permissions will determine which documents will be displayed on public page; according to the user's rights."
msgstr ""
"Dovoljenja bodo določila, kateri dokumenti bodo prikazani na javni strani; v "
"skladu s pravicami uporabnika."

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:41
#: c46f239bf9ab4d5ba9ad50faea36c6ff
msgid "Public list"
msgstr "Javni seznam"

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:43
#: 707f8f70e0084e369ccc771997e26caf
msgid "Documents public list is, as all public pages in Galette, related to \"Show public pages\" parameter from settings; but it's also related to specific access rights which has been set on each one."
msgstr ""
"Javni seznam dokumentov je, kot vse javne strani v Galette, povezan s "
"parametrom \"Prikaži javne strani\" iz nastavitev; vendar je povezano tudi s "
"posebnimi pravicami dostopa, ki so bile nastavljene za vsakega."

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:45
#: cd6c36cbe06d4063bb094ffe1f9429b4
msgid "Documents list from a simple member"
msgstr "Seznam dokumentov preprostega člana"

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:50
#: f077eceefb0a4c23af912061f0dc453c
msgid "On the above screenshot, a simple member is logged and can only see documents which are public and which are allowed for users. The internal document is restricted to staff members and therefore is not shown here."
msgstr ""
"Na zgornjem posnetku zaslona je prijavljen preprost član, ki si lahko ogleda "
"le javne dokumente, ki so dovoljeni uporabnikom. Interni dokument je omejen "
"na člane osebja in zato tukaj ni prikazan."
